The mediation model for each cross-omic edge:

\deqn{M = \alpha_0 + \alpha_1 X + \epsilon_1}
\deqn{Y = \beta_0 + \beta_1 X + \beta_2 M + \epsilon_2}

where X = exposure, M = metabolite (mediator),
